# Keep line endings LF everywhere, including in Windows working trees.
#
# Without this, Git's default autocrlf on Windows rewrites every file to CRLF
# on checkout, and `gofmt -l` then reports the entire repository as needing
# reformatting — which is what it did the first time CI ran there. The Go
# toolchain writes LF regardless of platform, so declaring it here is simply
# saying what is already true.
* text=auto eol=lf
